{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02038","headline":"杂曲歌辞 破阵乐 三 · 不详","name":"杂曲歌辞 破阵乐 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年胆气凌云，共许骁雄出羣。\n匹马城南挑战，单刀蓟北从军。\n一鼓鲜卑送欵，五饵单于解纷。\n誓欲成名报国，羞将开口论勳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02038.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02038","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}